fr:mainmatter.html:p:
If the string x consists characters x_1, x_2, \ldots , x_n then the
FA (S,\Sigma ,\delta ,s_0,S_A) accepts x iff there is a sequence

    \delta (
        \delta (
            \dots \delta (\delta (
                \delta (s_0,x_1),x_2),x_3)\dots ,
            x_{n-1}
        )
        ,x_n
    )\in  S_A

